<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>500 - Error interno</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    .error-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 100vh;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .error-code {
      font-size: 120px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #e74c3c;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .error-message {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .btn-home {
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background-color: #3498db;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .btn-home:hover {
      background-color: #2980b9;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="error-container">
    <h1 class="error-code">500</h1>
    <p class="error-message">Ha ocurrido un error interno. Intenta nuevamente más tarde.</p>
    <a href="/home" class="btn-home">Volver al inicio</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
